    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosia alikuwa na umri wa miaka minane alipoanza kutawala huko Yerusalemu, akatawala kwa miaka thelathini na mmoja. Mama yake alikuwa Yedida, binti Adaya, mkazi wa mji wa Boskathi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosia alitenda mema na alimpendeza Mwenyezi-Mungu. Alifuata mfano wa mfalme Daudi aliyemtangulia, na kushika amri za Mwenyezi-Mungu kwa makini.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katika mwaka wa kumi na nane wa utawala wake, mfalme alimtuma katibu Shafani, mwana wa Azalia, mwana wa Meshulamu, katika nyumba ya Mwenyezi-Mungu akisema, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nenda kwa kuhani mkuu Hilkia umwambie ahesabu zile fedha zilizoletwa katika nyumba ya Mwenyezi-Mungu ambazo mabawabu walizikusanya kutoka kwa watu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiasi cha fedha hizo zipewe wasimamizi wa marekebisho ya nyumba ya Mwenyezi-Mungu kulipa mishahara ya mafundi wanaofanya marekebisho, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yaani maseremala, wajenzi na waashi. Kiasi kingine kitumike kununua mbao na mawe yaliyochongwa kwa ajili ya kurekebisha nyumba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watu wanaosimamia ujenzi wasidaiwe kutoa hesabu ya matumizi ya fedha watakazokabidhiwa, kwa sababu wanazitumia kwa uaminifu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha kuhani mkuu Hilkia alimwambia katibu Shafani, “Nimekipata Kitabu cha Sheria katika nyumba ya Mwenyezi-Mungu.” Halafu Hilkia akampatia Shafani kitabu, naye akakisoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katibu Shafani, alimwendea mfalme na kutoa habari, akisema, “Watumishi wako wametoa fedha zilizopatikana katika nyumba halafu wamezikabidhi kwa mafundi wanaosimamia marekebisho ya nyumba ya Mwenyezi-Mungu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha katibu Shafani, akamwambia mfalme, “Kuhani Hilkia amenipa kitabu.” Naye Shafani akakisoma mbele ya mfalme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mfalme aliposikia maneno ya Kitabu cha Sheria, alirarua mavazi yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mara aliamuru kuhani Hilkia, Ahikamu mwana wa Shafani na Akbori mwana wa Mikaya pamoja na katibu Shafani na Asaya mtumishi wa mfalme, akisema, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nendeni mkatafute shauri kutoka kwa Mwenyezi-Mungu kwa niaba yangu na watu wa Yuda wote kuhusu maneno ya kitabu hiki kilichopatikana kwa sababu ghadhabu ya Mwenyezi-Mungu imewaka juu yetu, maana babu zetu hawakutii maneno ya kitabu hiki, na kutimiza yote yaliyoandikwa kutuhusu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa hiyo kuhani Hilkia, Ahikamu, Akbori, Shafani na Asaya, wote walikwenda kwa mama mmoja nabii jina lake Hulda aliyekuwa mke wa Shalumu, mwana wa Tikva, mwana wa Harhasi, mtunza mavazi ya hekalu. Wakati huo Hulda alikuwa anaishi katika mtaa wa pili wa Yerusalemu, nao wakazungumza naye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi akawaambia, “Hivi ndivyo anavyosema Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wa Israeli: ‘Mwambie huyo aliyewatuma kwangu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi-Mungu anasema hivi: Nitaleta uovu juu ya mahali hapa na juu ya wakazi wake kama ilivyo katika kitabu kilichosomwa na mfalme wa Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa sababu wameniacha na kufukizia ubani miungu mingine na hivyo kunikasirisha kwa kazi zote za mikono yao, ghadhabu yangu dhidi ya Yerusalemu itawaka na haitaweza kutulizwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini kuhusu mfalme wa Yuda aliyewatuma kutafuta shauri la Mwenyezi-Mungu, mwambie kwamba, hivi ndivyo anavyosema Mwenyezi-Mungu, Mungu wa Israeli, juu ya maneno uliyoyasikia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa kuwa umetubu na kunyenyekea mbele yangu, hata umerarua mavazi yako na kulia mbele yangu, hapo uliposikia niliyosema dhidi ya mahali hapa na dhidi ya wakazi wake, ya kwamba watakuwa ukiwa na laana, nami pia nimekusikia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa hiyo tazama, nitakukusanya pamoja na babu zako nawe utawekwa kaburini kwa amani, macho yako hayataona uovu nitakaouleta juu ya mahali hapa.’” Basi wajumbe wakamletea mfalme Yosia habari hizi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.22.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
